<title>UK: B.A.T no comment on Tabaqueira bid talk.</title>
<headline>B.A.T no comment on Tabaqueira bid talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>B.A.T Industries Plc said it would not comment on rumours that the British tobacco and insurance group may bid in the privatisation for Portuguese state-owned tobacco company Tabaqueira.</p>
<p>The bidding is due to be opened in Lisbon at 0900 GMT on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no comment,&quot; a B.A.T spokesman said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
